<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="nl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="default">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="Comeback">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#FAF9F5">
<title>Comeback</title>
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 180 180'><rect width='180' height='180' rx='40' fill='%230F6E56'/><circle cx='90' cy='90' r='52' fill='none' stroke='%23ffffff' stroke-width='10' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-dasharray='250 327' transform='rotate(-90 90 90)'/><circle cx='90' cy='90' r='10' fill='%23ffffff'/></svg>">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 180 180'><rect width='180' height='180' rx='40' fill='%230F6E56'/><circle cx='90' cy='90' r='52' fill='none' stroke='%23ffffff' stroke-width='10' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-dasharray='250 327' transform='rotate(-90 90 90)'/><circle cx='90' cy='90' r='10' fill='%23ffffff'/></svg>">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #FAF9F5;
    --bg-2: #F1EFE8;
    --bg-3: #FFFFFF;
    --text: #2B2B27;
    --text-2: #5F5E5A;
    --text-3: #8A8983;
    --border: #E5E3DB;
    --border-2: #CCC9BD;
    --info-bg: #E6F1FB;
    --info-text: #0C447C;
    --green: #0F6E56;
    --green-light: #5DCAA5;
    --red: #A32D2D;
    --red-light: #F09595;
    --orange-bg: #FAEEDA;
    --orange-text: #854F0B;
    --blue-bg: #E6F1FB;
    --blue-text: #0C447C;
    --radius-sm: 6px;
    --radius-md: 10px;
    --radius-lg: 14px;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }
  html, body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Helvetica Neue", "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  body {
    padding: env(safe-area-inset-top) env(safe-area-inset-right) env(safe-area-inset-bottom) env(safe-area-inset-left);
  }
  .container {
    max-width: 540px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 16px;
  }
  input, select, button, textarea { font: inherit; }
  input[type="text"], input[type="number"], select {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--bg-3);
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 15px;
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    appearance: none;
  }
  select {
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='12' height='8' viewBox='0 0 12 8'><path d='M1 1l5 5 5-5' stroke='%235F5E5A' stroke-width='1.5' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round'/></svg>");
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    background-position: right 12px center;
    padding-right: 30px;
  }
  input:focus, select:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--green); }
  button {
    padding: 10px 14px;
    background: var(--text);
    color: var(--bg);
    border: none;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  button:active { opacity: 0.7; }
 
  .app-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; margin-bottom: 14px; padding-top: 4px; }
  .app-title { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0; letter-spacing: -0.3px; }
  .app-date { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-2); }
 
  .tabs { display: flex; gap: 4px; padding: 4px; background: var(--bg-2); border-radius: var(--radius-md); margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .tab {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 9px 10px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-align: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }
  .tab.active { background: var(--bg-3); color: var(--text); box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.04); }
 
  .view { display: block; }
  .view.hidden { display: none; }
 
  .ring-block {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    background: var(--bg-2);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .ring-text { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .ring-main { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.4px; }
  .ring-main small { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-2); font-weight: 400; }
  .ring-sub { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-2); margin-top: 4px; }
  .ring-bonus { font-size: 12px; color: var(--green); margin-top: 2px; font-weight: 500; }
 
  .panel {
    background: var(--bg-3);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 14px 16px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .panel-h { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-2); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin: 0 0 10px; font-weight: 600; }
  .panel-h-large { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 12px; }
 
  .search-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 110px; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .search-results { max-height: 280px; overflow-y: auto; margin-bottom: 8px; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }
  .search-results.empty { display: none; }
  .search-result {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 9px 10px;
    cursor: pointer;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .search-result:active { background: var(--bg-2); }
  .search-result-cal { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-2); }
  .search-empty { padding: 12px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-3); font-style: italic; }
 
  .custom-toggle { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-2); background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer; padding: 4px 0; text-decoration: underline; }
  .custom-form { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 80px auto; gap: 8px; margin-top: 8px; }
  .custom-form.hidden { display: none; }
 
  .chip-grid { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }
  .chip {
    font-size: 13px;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    background: var(--bg-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    cursor: pointer;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .chip:active { background: var(--bg-3); }
  .chip-cal { color: var(--text-2); margin-left: 6px; font-size: 12px; }
 
  .fav-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 8px; }
  .fav-card {
    background: var(--bg-2);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 10px 12px;
    cursor: pointer;
    position: relative;
  }
  .fav-card:active { background: var(--bg-3); }
  .fav-name { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; padding-right: 18px; line-height: 1.3; }
  .fav-meta { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-2); margin-top: 4px; }
  .fav-x {
    position: absolute;
    top: 4px;
    right: 4px;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text-3);
    padding: 4px 6px;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .fav-empty { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-3); font-style: italic; padding: 4px 0; }
 
  .meal-section { margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .meal-head-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; margin-bottom: 6px; padding: 0 4px; }
  .meal-h2 { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-2); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-weight: 600; }
  .save-fav-btn { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-2); background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: underline; padding: 0; }
  .save-fav-btn.hidden { visibility: hidden; }
  .food-item {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 9px 12px;
    background: var(--bg-3);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .food-cal { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-2); margin-left: 12px; }
  .food-x {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--text-3);
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 0 0 0 10px;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .empty {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-style: italic;
    padding: 10px;
    text-align: center;
    background: var(--bg-2);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }
 
  .today-sessions { margin-top: 18px; }
 
  .week {
    background: var(--bg-3);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 12px 14px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .week.current { border: 2px solid var(--info-text); padding: 11px 13px; }
  .week-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .week-l { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .week-num { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
  .week-focus { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-2); }
  .week-prog { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-2); }
  .week-badge {
    font-size: 11px;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--info-bg);
    color: var(--info-text);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .ses { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 7px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .ses:first-of-type { border-top: none; padding-top: 4px; }
  .pill {
    font-size: 11px;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    min-width: 50px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .pill-run { background: var(--orange-bg); color: var(--orange-text); }
  .pill-walk { background: var(--blue-bg); color: var(--blue-text); }
  .ses-txt { font-size: 13px; flex: 1; line-height: 1.4; }
  .ses-txt.done { text-decoration: line-through; color: var(--text-3); }
  .ses input[type="checkbox"] { width: 20px; height: 20px; cursor: pointer; flex-shrink: 0; accent-color: var(--green); }
  .ses-burn { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-3); margin-right: 4px; white-space: nowrap; }
 
  .progress-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .stat-card { background: var(--bg-2); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 10px 12px; }
  .stat-l { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-2); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.4px; font-weight: 600; }
  .stat-v { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 4px; letter-spacing: -0.3px; }
  .stat-v small { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-2); font-weight: 400; }
 
  .weight-form { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 90px auto; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; align-items: center; }
  .chart-bars { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 6px; height: 100px; padding: 14px 4px 0; }
  .bar-col { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px; min-width: 0; }
  .bar { width: 100%; background: var(--green-light); border-radius: 3px 3px 0 0; min-height: 2px; position: relative; }
  .bar.over { background: var(--red-light); }
  .bar-l { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-2); }
  .bar-v { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-3); position: absolute; top: -14px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); white-space: nowrap; }
 
  .settings-row { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 10px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); font-size: 14px; gap: 12px; }
  .settings-row:first-of-type { border-top: none; }
  .settings-row input { width: 100px; }
 
  .footer { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; margin-top: 12px; }
  .reset-btn { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-2); background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: underline; padding: 4px 8px; }
  .legend-tip { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-3); margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.5; }
 
  .sr-only { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0,0,0,0); border: 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
  <h2 class="sr-only">Comeback — voeding loggen, hardloopschema en voortgang</h2>
  <div class="app-head">
    <p class="app-title">Comeback</p>
    <span class="app-date" id="today-date"></span>
  </div>
 
  <div class="tabs">
    <button class="tab active" data-tab="today">Vandaag</button>
    <button class="tab" data-tab="schedule">Schema</button>
    <button class="tab" data-tab="progress">Voortgang</button>
  </div>
 
  <div class="view" id="view-today">
    <div class="ring-block">
      <svg width="80" height="80" viewBox="0 0 80 80" aria-hidden="true">
        <circle cx="40" cy="40" r="34" fill="none" stroke="#E5E3DB" stroke-width="6"/>
        <circle id="ring-fg" cx="40" cy="40" r="34" fill="none" stroke="#0F6E56" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="213.6" stroke-dashoffset="213.6" transform="rotate(-90 40 40)"/>
      </svg>
      <div class="ring-text">
        <div class="ring-main"><span id="cal-eaten">0</span> <small>/ <span id="cal-target">2400</span> kcal</small></div>
        <div class="ring-sub" id="cal-remaining">2400 kcal te gaan</div>
        <div class="ring-bonus" id="cal-bonus" style="display: none;"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
 
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="panel-h">Toevoegen</div>
      <div class="search-row">
        <input type="text" id="search" placeholder="Zoek voedingsmiddel..." autocomplete="off">
        <select id="meal-select">
          <option value="ontbijt">Ontbijt</option>
          <option value="lunch">Lunch</option>
          <option value="diner">Diner</option>
          <option value="snack">Snack</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="search-results empty" id="search-results"></div>
      <button class="custom-toggle" id="custom-toggle">+ Eigen item toevoegen</button>
      <div class="custom-form hidden" id="custom-form">
        <input type="text" id="custom-name" placeholder="Naam">
        <input type="number" id="custom-cal" placeholder="kcal" min="0" inputmode="numeric">
        <button id="add-custom">+</button>
      </div>
    </div>
 
    <div class="panel" id="recents-panel" style="display: none;">
      <div class="panel-h">Recent gebruikt</div>
      <div class="chip-grid" id="recents"></div>
    </div>
 
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="panel-h">Favorieten</div>
      <div id="favorites"></div>
      <div class="legend-tip">Sla onderaan een hele maaltijd op als favoriet — dan voeg je 'm volgende keer met één klik weer toe.</div>
    </div>
 
    <div class="meal-section" id="meal-ontbijt">
      <div class="meal-head-row">
        <span class="meal-h2">Ontbijt</span>
        <button class="save-fav-btn hidden" data-meal="ontbijt">+ bewaar als favoriet</button>
      </div>
      <div class="meal-list"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="meal-section" id="meal-lunch">
      <div class="meal-head-row">
        <span class="meal-h2">Lunch</span>
        <button class="save-fav-btn hidden" data-meal="lunch">+ bewaar als favoriet</button>
      </div>
      <div class="meal-list"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="meal-section" id="meal-diner">
      <div class="meal-head-row">
        <span class="meal-h2">Diner</span>
        <button class="save-fav-btn hidden" data-meal="diner">+ bewaar als favoriet</button>
      </div>
      <div class="meal-list"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="meal-section" id="meal-snack">
      <div class="meal-head-row">
        <span class="meal-h2">Snack</span>
        <button class="save-fav-btn hidden" data-meal="snack">+ bewaar als favoriet</button>
      </div>
      <div class="meal-list"></div>
    </div>
 
    <div class="today-sessions">
      <div class="meal-h2" style="margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 0 4px;">Trainingen deze week</div>
      <div id="today-sess-list"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
 
  <div class="view hidden" id="view-schedule">
    <div id="weeks"></div>
  </div>
 
  <div class="view hidden" id="view-progress">
    <div class="progress-grid">
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-l">Sessies</div>
        <div class="stat-v"><span id="p-sess">0</span><small>/24</small></div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-l">Gewicht</div>
        <div class="stat-v" id="p-weight">—</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-l">Naar doel</div>
        <div class="stat-v" id="p-diff">—</div>
      </div>
    </div>
 
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="panel-h-large">Calorieën — laatste 7 dagen</div>
      <div class="chart-bars" id="cal-chart"></div>
      <div class="legend-tip">Groen = onder je doel. Rood = erboven. Eén dag erboven is geen probleem — kijk naar het patroon.</div>
    </div>
 
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="panel-h-large">Gewicht bijhouden</div>
      <div class="weight-form">
        <span style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-2);">Vandaag</span>
        <input type="number" id="weight-input" placeholder="kg" step="0.1" min="0" inputmode="decimal">
        <button id="weight-save">Opslaan</button>
      </div>
      <div id="weight-history" style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-2);"></div>
      <div class="legend-tip">Tip: weeg jezelf hooguit 1× per week, op dezelfde dag, voor het ontbijt.</div>
    </div>
 
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="panel-h-large">Instellingen</div>
      <div class="settings-row">
        <span>Calorie&shy;doel</span>
        <input type="number" id="target-input" min="1200" max="4000" step="50" inputmode="numeric">
      </div>
      <div class="settings-row">
        <span>Streefgewicht</span>
        <input type="number" id="goal-weight-input" step="0.1" min="0" placeholder="kg" inputmode="decimal">
      </div>
      <div class="legend-tip">Stel hoger in als je honger krijgt — beter langzaam afvallen dan opgeven.</div>
    </div>
 
    <div class="footer">
      <button class="reset-btn" id="reset">Alle data wissen</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
 
